---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="You're subscribed" description="Almost there — tell us the area you want watched and where to send alerts.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="wgrid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--ember">Priority alerts</span>
          <h1>You're in. One last thing.</h1>
          <p class="wlede">PayPal has your payment and your email, but it doesn't tell us <em>where</em> you are — and without that we can't watch the right area or text you. Thirty seconds and you're done.</p>

          <div class="notice wwarn">
            <p><strong>While you're here:</strong> if you haven't already, sign up for your provincial emergency alerts too. They're free, they're the authority, and their evacuation orders are binding. We're the second layer, not the first. <a href="/alerts/#official">Links to every provincial agency</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form name="alert-details" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" action="/alerts/thanks/" class="wform">
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="alert-details" />
          <input type="hidden" name="subscription-id" id="subscription-id" />
          <p class="hidden"><label>Leave this empty: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>

          <label>Name<input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label>
          <label>Email <span class="wopt">the same one you used with PayPal</span>
            <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
          <label>Mobile number <span class="wopt">for texts</span>
            <input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+1 604 555 0123" required /></label>
          <label>Postal or ZIP code <span class="wopt">the area we watch</span>
            <input type="text" name="postal" autocomplete="postal-code" placeholder="V1Y 1A1" required /></label>
          <label>Anything we should know? <span class="wopt">optional</span>
            <textarea name="notes" rows="2" placeholder="Second property, acreage, someone in the house with a respiratory condition…"></textarea></label>

          <label class="wcheck">
            <input type="checkbox" name="consent" required />
            <span>I understand Priority Alerts supplements official emergency alerts and does not replace them, and that delivery can fail. I agree to receive texts and emails from Killflare and can stop any time by replying STOP or emailing dave@clickshift.ca.</span>
          </label>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--ember">Finish setup</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var p = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('sub');
      var f = document.getElementById('subscription-id');
      if (p && f) f.value = p;
    })();
  </script>
</Base>
<style>
  .wgrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); align-items: start; }
  .wgrid h1 { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .wlede { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 1rem; }
  .wlede em { font-style: italic; }
  .wwarn { margin-top: 1.5rem; }

  .wform { display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 4px solid var(--hunter); padding: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.6rem); }
  .wform label { display: grid; gap: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .wopt { font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 0.78rem; }
  .wform input[type="text"], .wform input[type="email"], .wform input[type="tel"], .wform textarea {
    font: inherit; font-size: 0.94rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); border-radius: 0;
  }
  .wform input:focus-visible, .wform textarea:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 1px; }
  .wcheck { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 0.6rem; align-items: start; font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 0.3rem; }
  .wcheck input { margin-top: 0.2rem; }
  .wform button { justify-self: start; margin-top: 0.4rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .hidden { display: none; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .wgrid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
